    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061219.0086\n\nBEIJING, Dec 19 , 2006, 2006\n\nUS, North Korea hold first direct talks in six-party forum\n\n\n\n\nThe United States and North Korea Tuesday held their first direct talks on Pyongyang's nuclear weapons since multilateral disarmament negotiations resumed here after a 13-month break, officials said.\n\n\"The US and North Korean delegations are meeting this afternoon,\" a spokesman at the Chinese press center for the six-nation talks told AFP.\n\nA South Korean official confirmed that chief US envoy Christopher Hill had met directly with his counterpart from North Korea, Kim Kye-Gwan.",
